# =============================================================================
# Secret material — never commit. See AGENTS.md §9.
# Added 2026-08-11: a real credential export was sitting untracked in the working
# directory and `git add .` attempted to stage it. Only a root-owned 0600 file mode
# prevented it — that is luck, not a control.
# =============================================================================

